WEBVTT

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:02.950
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.380
Battle!

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.690
Centurion attacks Warrant.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:13.390
If all attacks get through, Blood 
Shepherd will run out of LP.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.090
What an abrupt ending.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:19.830
Not yet!  I've figured out your attack!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.300
I activate the Continuous Trap, Snatch Drone!

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.200
I destroy Judgment Arrows!

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.040
What?

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:30.650
Now all your monsters will be destroyed.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:34.280
Not bad.  But that won't happen.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.510
Decurion's effect.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:40.830
When another effect destroys 
an Armatos Legio...

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:45.780
...I can send it to the graveyard 
to negate the destruction.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:51.360
Centurion attacks Warrant!

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.510
Fortis Lux!

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.010
Light Ignis...

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:10.100
It's time for you to abandon all hope!

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:33.320
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:40.110
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:47.430
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:54.000
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.750
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:07.980
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:14.690
I want to share your pain

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:01.450
Who should I root for in this duel?

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:05.450
Both Blood Shepherd and 
Lightning are our enemies.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:09.170
They won't duel without risking something.

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:10.140
Yeah.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:15.620
So if Blood Shepherd wins, 
Lightning will have to pay up.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:18.600
Maybe he'll free him.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:23.080
Then we want Blood Shepherd to win.

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:25.460
Go, Blood Shepherd!

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.050
Pummel Lightning!

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:28.460
Brother...

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:35.790
Since Blood Shepherd destroyed the 
Link Spell, will he win this duel?

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.900
I'm not sure.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:44.380
The Light Ignis used an effect to prevent 
all its monsters from being destroyed.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:46.040
That means...

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:51.380
It may have anticipated that his 
Link Spell would be destroyed.

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:57.350
So this duel may go in an 
unpredictable direction.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:00.090
My turn!  I draw!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:02.740
I summon Drone Pawn!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.560
Battledrone General's effect activates!

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:11.030
I Special Summon a Drone from 
my graveyard next to its link!

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:14.240
Resurrect, Scud Drone!

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.880
Scud Drone's effect activates!

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:25.940
When a Drone's effect Special Summons 
it, I draw a card from my deck!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:29.410
Come out!  The circuit that leads to victory!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.420
I set Scud Drone in the Link Marker!

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:34.780
Link Summon!

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:39.460
Appear, Link 1 Battledrone Sergeant!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.800
General's effect activates!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:45.660
It lets Drone Pawn attack you directly.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.630
Drone Pawn attacks you directly!

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:53.940
Jin!

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:58.970
Lightning is controlling Jin, like a puppet.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:02.020
I'm sorry I can't do anything!

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.730
General's effect activates!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:11.690
By tributing a Drone that attacked you 
directly, you take damage equal to its ATK!

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.980
Then Sergeant's effect activates!

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:26.670
When another Drone attacks you directly, 
this card can attack you directly!

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.140
Do it, Sergeant!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.780
Due to General's effect, I tribute Sergeant!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.790
You take damage equal to its ATK!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:49.590
You're persistent.

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:51.510
I'm done with my opener.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.800
General attacks Centurion!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:00.040
Wow!  He already cornered Lightning!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.600
General has 2400 ATK.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:08.280
If this attack succeeds, Blood Shepherd 
will have the overwhelming advantage.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.740
Centurion's effect activates!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:24.030
When an Armatos Legio is attacked, 
the attack can be negated once!

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.000
It had that effect?

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:34.740
I activate the Continuous Spell, Drone Unity!

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:44.720
When a Drone is attacked, its ATK become 
the total ATK of all Drones on my field!

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:47.000
I see.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:51.690
But General is the only monster 
you have on your field.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.580
No one asked for your opinion.

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.890
I end my turn.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:59.360
Warrant's effect activates 
at the end of the turn!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:03.600
When there are no monsters 
in my Main Monster Zone...

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:06.000
...I can Special Summon 
it from the graveyard!

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:13.580
Now you need a monster with 3600 
ATK to attack Blood Shepherd.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:18.250
I see.  He prepared for 
Lightning's counterattack.

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:21.430
My turn.  I draw.

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:25.660
I activate the Continuous Spell, Armatos Lex!

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:31.130
I return Judgment Arrows from my graveyard 
to my deck to add Gradius to my hand!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:32.360
What?

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:37.170
Return to my deck!  The Link 
Spell. Judgment Arrows!

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:45.470
Judgment Arrows returned to his deck!

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:49.280
He's planning to use his Link Spell again!

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:57.520
Like I thought, the Light Ignis anticipated 
that its Link Spell would be destroyed.

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:01.490
The Field Spell, Armatos 
Colosseum's effect activates!

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:04.230
I send Gradius from my hand to the graveyard.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:07.930
I Special Summon Speculata and Seeker 
from my graveyard in defense position

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:10.740
next to Centurion's links!

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.180
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:20.350
I set Speculata and Link 2 
Centurion in the Link Markers!

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:24.880
My light becomes eternal, 
my power becomes the truth!

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:28.320
Shine on everything and create the path!

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:36.400
Appear, Link 3 Armatos 
Legio Legatus Legionis!

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:42.350
This is Lightning's Link 3 monster!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.240
His ace has appeared!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.700
Here I go.  Battle!

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:51.180
Centurion attacks Battledrone General!

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:55.440
A monster with lower ATK 
is attacking General?

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.380
Seeker's effect.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:03.140
When an Armatos Legio linked to 
Seeker attacks your monster...

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.960
...your monster is destroyed.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:08.860
What?

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.710
What happened?

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:15.330
That monster can give an 
effect to a Link Monster.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:19.880
When linked, it gains the 
linked monster's weapon.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.630
It can use an effect that keeps changing.

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.040
That's trouble.

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:30.320
Legatus Legionis attacks Battledrone Warrant!

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:51.300
I end my turn.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:54.410
My turn.  I draw!

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:58.860
I summon Drone Recycler from my hand!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:02.320
I activate Drone Recycler's effect!

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:05.680
I banish a Drone Link 
Monster from my graveyard.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:11.390
I Special Summon a Drone from my hand whose 
Level is equal to that monster's Link Markers.

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:18.930
I banish Link 2 Warrant to Special Summon 
Level 2 Drone Carrier in defense position!

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:21.670
Drone Carrier's effect activates!

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:29.410
When a Drone's effect Special Summons it, I 
can Special Summon a Drone from my graveyard!

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:32.200
Resurrect, General!

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.570
General's effect activates!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:41.320
I Special Summon a Drone from 
my graveyard next to its link!

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.750
Come, Drone Pawn!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:51.040
Level 2 Drone Carrier tunes 
Level 4 Drone Recycler!

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.510
Tune?

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:06.590
The elite sharpshooter with no equal.

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:10.630
Fire your bullet at your prey!

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.660
Synchro Summon.

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:21.040
Level 6 Commandrone Double Sniper!

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:25.430
General's effect activates!

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:28.930
Drone Pawn can attack you directly this turn!

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:33.650
I see.  Then allow me to prepare for battle.

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:36.540
Legatus Legionis's effect activates!

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:42.940
I select a Level 4 or lower Armatos 
Legio on my field and in my graveyard.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:48.290
I send the one from the field to the 
graveyard to Special Summon the one from the graveyard.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.990
I exchange Seeker with 
Scutum in my graveyard.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:12:00.940
When Scutum is linked to an 
Armatos Legio Link Monster...

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:04.670
...you're only allowed to 
attack the Link Monster.

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:09.410
In other words, you're only 
allowed to attack Centurion.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:17.360
But that doesn't matter 
if it's a direct attack.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:20.450
Battle!  Go, Drone Pawn!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:24.690
The Continuous Spell, Armatos 
Lex's effect activates!

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:29.990
When we both have monsters on our 
fields, the direct attack is negated!

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:34.230
It also has that effect?

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:37.470
Lightning's defense is solid!

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:39.090
You're right.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:43.440
This solid formation can't easily be broken.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:46.840
In that case, Double Sniper's effect!

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:50.920
Every time an attack is negated, 
I place a Drone Counter on it!

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:54.910
When it has at least one Drone Counter...

00:12:54.910 --> 00:13:00.390
...it can attack twice, and 
it can attack you directly!

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:06.360
But if it uses this effect to attack 
you directly, its ATK become 1000.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.830
Double Sniper attacks you directly!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.950
Why is Blood Shepherd attacking directly?

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:18.740
Since he has Armatos Lex, it'll be negated.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:21.160
He has another goal.

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:22.580
Another goal?

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:24.280
Keep trying - it won't work.

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:28.750
Armatos Lex negates the direct attack!

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:36.930
Now Double Sniper's effect!

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:39.480
I place one Drone Counter.

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:44.140
Then Double Sniper attacks Centurion!

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.660
Centurion's effect activates!

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:50.980
An attack on Armatos Legio is negated once!

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.980
This is the moment I was waiting for.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:14:00.150
Double Sniper's effect when it 
has two Drone Counters activates!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:05.260
When your monster's effect activates, 
it's negated and destroyed.

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:07.690
And you take 1000 damage!

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:12.350
Effect negation and destruction.  And damage.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:13.630
How powerful!

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:17.100
This is what Blood Shepherd was aiming for.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:20.980
But it won't happen.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.810
Scutum's effect activates!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:30.470
Once per turn, the Armatos Legio linked to this 
card can't be destroyed in battle or by effects.

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:38.320
In that case, Double 
Sniper attacks Centurion!

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.260
You take damage.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.200
I didn't expect you to attack this well.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:57.680
I don't do weak attacks that AIs can predict!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:01.150
You think there's something we can't predict?

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:04.950
Did you predicted this upcoming attack?

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.620
General attacks Centurion!

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:19.010
It has 200 LP left.

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:23.100
He has completely cornered Lightning.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:27.540
With low LP, if any attack 
gets through, it's over.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:30.540
Impressive, Blood Shepherd.

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:34.520
He's dueled beyond what I warned him about.

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:37.750
I end my attacks.

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:40.750
But I won't allow you to counterattack!

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:43.850
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Drone Unity's effect!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:48.330
I can tribute a Drone to 
draw a card from my deck!

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.260
I tribute Drone Pawn and draw!

00:15:55.970 --> 00:16:00.000
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Drone Force Fusion!

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:07.320
I Fusion Summon using my Drones!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:10.980
This card's activation and 
effect can't be negated!

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:16.480
I fuse Commandrone Double Sniper 
and Battledrone General!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:20.420
He's using his ace monsters to Fusion Summon?

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:24.400
I'll show you that my dueling 
is better than yours!

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:33.590
My most powerful soldier and commander now 
become one to build an impregnable fortress!

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.310
Fusion Summon!

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:38.730
Fortressdrone Beehive!

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:46.720
The monster Fusion Summoned using Drone 
Force Fusion can't be destroyed by effects.

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:50.050
And when Beehive is Fusion Summoned...

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:54.410
...it gains a Drone Counter for 
every Fusion Material Drone's Level.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.680
The total Level is 6!

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:00.660
Beehive's effect activates!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:07.270
I remove as many Drone Counters as I like to 
Special Summon the same number of Drone Tokens.

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:13.000
I remove 5 counters to Special 
Summon 5 Drone Tokens!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:22.590
Fortressdrone Beehive gains 1000 ATK 
for each Drone, other than itself.

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:28.290
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.650
5000 ATK!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:34.300
The five Tokens have 0 ATK.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:40.300
But when they're attacked, Drone Unity's 
effect raises them to 5000 ATK.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:42.270
It's solid!

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:45.280
I see.  What a wonderful sight.

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.250
It's fun for the climax OF a duel.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.960
Now it's my turn.  I draw.

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:56.450
I got a fun card too.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:02.130
From my hand, I activate the 
Link Spell, Judgment Arrows!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.730
He's really good at drawing.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:10.470
It'll now play Judgment Arrows.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:13.770
The Continuous Trap, Snatch Drone's effect!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:19.010
If it already destroyed a copy of 
your card, your effect is negated!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:23.850
In other words, Judgment 
Arrows's effect is negated!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:33.060
Then I activate the Continuous Trap, Capture 
Drone's effect on Legatus Legionis!

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:40.930
The target Link Monster has its effects 
negated, and can't be used to Link Summon or tributed!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:45.040
And your Link Monsters can't attack!

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:54.220
Wow!  He stopped Judgment Arrows's 
effect and Legatus Legionis!

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:58.420
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Armatos Lex's effect!

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:01.850
I tribute Scutum to draw!

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:05.120
Well, not bad.

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:09.450
Lightning is acting confident.

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:12.460
Is he going to turn this around?

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:14.210
Here I go.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:18.840
I summon Armatos Legio Magica Alcum!

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:26.820
When it's summoned next to an Armatos 
Legio Link Monster's link...

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:33.620
...it activates its effect on Judgment 
Arrows, which is next to the Link Monster's link.

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:38.090
Armatos Legio can't be destroyed 
by effects this turn.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:41.590
Then I send Judgment Arrows to the graveyard.

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:43.560
What?

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:47.030
He let go of Judgment Arrows?

00:19:52.980 --> 00:20:01.660
All faceup cards in your Spell & Trap 
Zone and Main Monster Zone are destroyed!

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.380
What?

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:11.560
When Judgment Arrows leaves the field, all 
monsters next to its links are destroyed.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:17.860
But the Armatos Legio affected by Magica 
Alcum's effect is protected from destruction.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:31.480
With all the Drones gone, 
Beehive's ATK become 0.

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:37.950
All his traps are destroyed, so there's 
no way to stop Lightning's monster!

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.180
Brother!

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:47.120
Legatus Legionis attacks 
Fortressdrone Beehive!

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:08.150
Judgment Arrows and an Armatos 
Legio that powers it up.

00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:11.120
Lightning's deck is too powerful!

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:16.160
Blood Shepherd!

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:21.170
I guess I couldn't help you.

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:22.290
Me?

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:26.260
It's a brother's responsibility 
to protect his sister.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:30.230
That's why you acted on your own?

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.540
Sorry, Emma.

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:37.340
Brother!

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:39.810
Brother?

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:46.540
Blood Shepherd made no mistakes, 
but it defeated him.

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:50.640
The Light Ignis is a fearsome foe.

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:55.050
Next time, you're up.

00:21:55.050 --> 00:21:57.810
Hope you look forward to it.

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:01.470
Lightning!

00:22:21.930 --> 00:22:23.430
Trapped in conventionality

00:22:23.430 --> 00:22:24.870
Even denials are obvious

00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:26.000
That There This Whichever

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:27.840
Hey, isn't it true?

00:22:28.170 --> 00:22:29.500
Why is it before you wake up

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:31.070
You build a wall, saying it's impossible

